Reused artifacts and sources:

1. Runtime dependency `io.github.kyant0:backdrop:2.0.0`
   (contains the original AGSL shaders: RoundedRectRefraction,
   RoundedRectRefractionWithDispersion, DefaultHighlight, AmbientHighlight,
   together with the original render pipeline and default parameters).
   Used unmodified. No visual parameter has been changed.

2. Runtime dependency `io.github.kyant0:shapes:1.2.0`
   (transitive runtime dependency of backdrop 2.0.0; provides the G2-continuous
   iOS corner shapes used by every upstream sample component).
   https://github.com/Kyant0/Shapes
   Copyright 2025 Kyant — Apache License, Version 2.0.

3. Application-layer helpers ported from the upstream catalog module
   (`app/src/commonMain/kotlin/com/kyant/backdrop/catalog/…`):
     - utils/DragGestureInspector.kt
     - utils/DampedDragAnimation.kt
     - utils/InteractiveHighlight.kt
     - utils/UISensor.kt (androidMain)
     - components/LiquidButton.kt
     - components/LiquidToggle.kt
     - components/LiquidSlider.kt
     - components/LiquidBottomTab.kt
     - components/LiquidBottomTabs.kt
   Only package names were adapted; all effect parameters are unchanged.

4. Wallpaper artwork `app/src/main/res/drawable/wallpaper_light.webp`
   taken from the upstream catalog resources (Apache License, Version 2.0).

